<description>&lt;p&gt;A Catholic priest was killed when a massive wooden crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Ecuador. U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador and conducting anti-drug strikes at sea that seize crews and destroy boats. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation produced 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust and nightly curfews were imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNdWpyTm02U05wSTRSZFlyRWNna2JKSVBLYmtGemxBZkgxb3FzbTd0MXF1clRRSTk1dWJQdzVHME5RajlvRHdYQnJodVhUOFRMcWU3LW95UVAyMFRyT3hDV3ppdGJQZ0ZEMXdybFEtN2lsdXJUY1FmN1BSNHhMbEg2dVRaeVp0UHM3RmVmR1hIWWtsZlMtS0RyanZrQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;PM News Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOVlFRYjNSeU5GLXVhZk1vX3lydTBKY0lrV1FzRUlzbURhQVBlckNGRENEMENnc29jZnp1NVEzTXBoZUVfQUtEMzVJZ0pnQlpLNnZwWlM0cHNlUkdEN2JPOTV0dFhRb2xhcDdHQXNyZzFUSFM3VlpzQmRVWkl5ZVdEc1FSVHdWZHR6bjA0ZVNCelVNZG9TSGsyY1Q4VXV3X0xoVUhGUDdMZk1iSHZtMlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dimsum Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQUjJnbmo4aVUzVWhZOFhOWWoweDB3V0g2VWNMZExoRUd0czRuQnpKTWZ3MWdMM3M3UkJkeU41WHNLaE5sTEREZzFFOVZuTzdTRzNZbU5CdUQ4WExxa2REN0d4ZHBRNEw5QzRaRXh4VUltM3BWWFdGN3VMNGxwRE5xR3FRQjFoWFdGTTZmZndKSmdEV2JoaHRaeDFZV1BUQ2FWcTRWTkFSS0VsTTdCRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFB3VXhLZnlUUDRLYjN3ZkVnenhQQWstWlRCTXkyZkJoeFVvUFlKeDZwbzEwalcwalhnS3JDOThPcTlXalhRX2hWNVN0ZUFSQWI3YmM3eGd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CB